<title>USA: Ameritech boosts stock repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Ameritech boosts stock repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp said on Friday it has authorized an increase in its share repurchase plan to 25 million shares from 20 million.</p>
<p>The plan was originally approved last December and expires on December 31, Ameritech said.</p>
<p>Ameritech is a local telecommunications services provider.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1 Friday at 61-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
